    {
      "name": "FixpMessage",
      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/fixp/FixpMessage",
      "description": "One FIXP message, as its fields would be read from the wire before or after encoding.",
      "comments": [
        "The FIXP files define each message as an SBE message template, which lmodel/fix-sbe models as SbeMessageV1, and as an Orchestra message, which lmodel/fix-orchestra models as OrchestraMessageV10. A record of those classes defines a kind of message; an instance of this class is one message of that kind."
      ],
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/fixp/schema/fixp_core",
      "related_mappings": [
        "fix_sbe:SbeMessageV1",
        "fix_orchestra:OrchestraMessageV10"
      ],
